WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.432
The pirate faces right. On this example island, the chest is one square ahead.

00:00:06.432 --> 00:00:10.949
Click Move once. It goes into your code below Start.

00:00:10.949 --> 00:00:16.151
Click Collect. The pirate must stand on the chest before collecting.

00:00:16.151 --> 00:00:21.841
Click Test my code. Watch the pirate take one step and collect the treasure.
